From 292d46899fe7278830a0d9b1342751e502c31d08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 20:31:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 60/97] spec-decode: annotate MTP draft KV cache groups
 positionally on the hybrid path (port of upstream #55390)

Port of the upstream vLLM change #55390 (Apache-2.0). On the hybrid grouping path the MTP draft's KV cache group is identified by
position. The only conflict was a docstring; upstream's text was taken.
---
 tests/v1/core/test_kv_cache_utils.py | 96 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 vllm/v1/core/kv_cache_utils.py       | 59 ++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 134 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)

